  "figmaOnly": {
    "_note": "Figma only. These exist as Figma variables, text styles or variable splits and are not in tokens.css. Spacing steps resolve in CSS through Tailwind (--spacing); text styles are Tailwind class combinations; pl-shadow-overlay-color is the colour part of --pl-shadow-overlay. WEB code syntax in Figma is the CSS shown here.",
